# phthalimide.msf
# Phthalimide (isoindole-1,3(2H)-dione)
# pKa=8.300 (N-H imide acid, q=0→-1)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# Aromatic cyclic imide N-H acid. Fills the pKa 7-9 gap which has the
# worst RMSE of any range (0.82). The fused benzene ring delocalises
# charge into the aromatic system upon deprotonation → large ΔBO_ring.
# Bridges barbituric acid (C-H, pKa=4.01) and saccharin (N-H, pKa=1.60)
# with an aromatic N-H imide at an intermediate pKa.

